"use strict";(self.webpackChunkwp_woocommerce_pre_order_doc=self.webpackChunkwp_woocommerce_pre_order_doc||[]).push([[207],{2401(e,t,r){r.r(t),r.d(t,{_pageData:()=>s,default:()=>a});var i=r(641);const s=JSON.parse('{"path":"/woocommerce-pre-order/waitlist-enquiries.html","title":"Waitlists & Enquiry Threads","lang":"en-US","frontmatter":{},"git":{},"filePathRelative":"woocommerce-pre-order/waitlist-enquiries.md"}'),o={name:"waitlist-enquiries.md"},a=(0,r(6262).A)(o,[["render",function(e,t,r,s,o,a){return(0,i.uX)(),(0,i.CE)("div",null,[...t[0]||(t[0]=[(0,i.Fv)('<h1 id="waitlists-enquiry-threads" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#waitlists-enquiry-threads"><span>Waitlists &amp; Enquiry Threads</span></a></h1><p>The plugin provides two distinct customer communication tools to capture shopper interest and resolve customer questions directly on your pre-order product pages:</p><ol><li><strong>Back-in-Stock Waitlist (&quot;Notify Me&quot;):</strong> Shoppers can subscribe to automated email alerts that notify them when an out-of-stock product returns to stock.</li><li><strong>Pre-Order Enquiry System (&quot;Ask Query&quot;):</strong> Shoppers submit detailed questions, initiating threaded support chats directly with store administrators.</li></ol><hr><h2 id="_1-back-in-stock-notify-me-waitlist" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-back-in-stock-notify-me-waitlist"><span>1. Back-in-Stock &quot;Notify Me&quot; Waitlist</span></a></h2><p>When a pre-order product sells out, or when a standard catalog item runs out of stock, the plugin displays a <strong>Notify Me</strong> button next to the standard purchase layout.</p><h3 id="the-subscription-flow" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#the-subscription-flow"><span>The Subscription Flow</span></a></h3><ul><li><strong>For Logged-In Customers:</strong> The user subscribes with a single click. The plugin retrieves their account name and email automatically.</li><li><strong>For Guest Shoppers:</strong> Clicking the button opens a modal popup where guests enter their Name, Email Address, and Phone Number.</li><li><strong>Preventing Duplicates:</strong> If a customer submits their email multiple times for the same product, the system updates their subscription date rather than creating duplicate records, ensuring they only receive a single email notification when the item returns.</li></ul><h3 id="how-notifications-are-sent" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#how-notifications-are-sent"><span>How Notifications are Sent</span></a></h3><p>When you restock the product (updating its status to <code>In Stock</code> in WooCommerce):</p><ol><li>The plugin searches for all waitlisted subscribers for that product.</li><li>The system automatically sends a personalized email alert to all subscribers using the <strong>Pre-Order Back in Stock</strong> mail template.</li><li>Subscribers are marked as notified so they are not emailed multiple times.</li></ol><hr><h2 id="_2-pre-order-enquiry-system" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_2-pre-order-enquiry-system"><span>2. Pre-Order Enquiry System</span></a></h2><p>The Pre-Order Enquiry System allows shoppers to submit questions regarding release dates, pricing, or product specifications before committing to a purchase.</p><h3 id="submitting-a-query" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#submitting-a-query"><span>Submitting a Query</span></a></h3><p>If the <strong>Enquiry Form</strong> is enabled in your configuration:</p><ul><li>An <strong>Ask Query</strong> button appears on the pre-order product page.</li><li>Clicking the button opens a popup form asking for: <ul><li><em>Name</em> (Pre-filled for logged-in users)</li><li><em>Email</em> (Pre-filled for logged-in users)</li><li><em>Phone Number</em> (Optional)</li><li><em>Subject / Question</em> (Textarea)</li></ul></li><li><strong>Spam Prevention:</strong> Submissions have built-in security and rate limits (lockouts after rapid submissions) to block automated spam bots from flooding your inbox.</li></ul><h3 id="threaded-conversations" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#threaded-conversations"><span>Threaded Conversations</span></a></h3><p>Administrators view and manage inquiries under <strong>WooCommerce</strong> &gt; <strong>Pre-Order List</strong> &gt; <strong>Enquiries</strong> tab.</p><p><img src="/woocommerce-pre-order/images/woocommerce-pre-order/admin-enquiries-list.png" alt="Admin Enquiries Dashboard &amp; Threaded Chats"></p><ul><li><p><strong>Chat Interface:</strong> Clicking an inquiry opens the conversation panel.</p><p><img src="/woocommerce-pre-order/images/woocommerce-pre-order/admin-reply-thread.png" alt="Admin Inquiry Chat Reply Thread"></p><p>Administrators can:</p><ul><li>Review past messages chronologically in a chat bubble format.</li><li>Change the thread status (e.g. from <em>Pending</em> to <em>Closed</em>).</li><li>Write a reply inside the editor and click <strong>Send Reply</strong>.</li></ul></li><li><p><strong>Customer Notification:</strong> Sending a reply automatically emails the customer with the admin&#39;s response, keeping them updated without requiring them to check the site.</p></li></ul>',21)])])}]])}}]);